The agent reads `quill.d/`, a folder with a file for each setting. What changed from 3.4: [Upgrade the agent](/upgrade/).

## Set the API key <ascribe-attributes id="set-the-api-key"></ascribe-attributes>

Put the key in `quill.d/key`. To make one, see [API keys](/keys/).
